{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人關嘉敏（Carman）早前在節目中大爆入行以來的辛酸史，指過往拍攝親熱戲時，曾遭同劇男對手未經溝通擅自「加戲」，做出超乎劇本範圍的親密舉動，令她大感困擾並留下心理陰影。</p><p>雖然關嘉敏未有公開涉事男星身份，但由於她過往拍過親熱戲的對手屈指可數</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T08:22:13.501034+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T08:01:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T08:15:24.383888+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T08:15:24.383888+00:00","content_hash":"2f10b868434d99ef94aa9c3a65b76a92fab357815366b3afee3f65c31ae9f7c9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}